  "description": "ConFurtiva, a name from the Spanish wordplay \"Convicción Furtiva\", was a furry convention in Mexico organized by FurryMX, and the first attempt to hold a furry convention in Mexico. The first edition, run by ConFurMex, took place November 22 to 23, 2008, in Xochitepec near Cuernavaca, about 50 miles south of Mexico City, as a limited-admission event for up to 70 attendees. The convention returned in 2019 in Mexico City, at the Ritz hotel in the historic downtown, and was held online in 2020.",
